<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ulmus</span></b> , i, f. (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>masc.</i>, <i><span class="en">Cat. 62,
			54</span></i>; 
				v.
				infra
			), <i>an elm</i>, <i>elm-tree.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 17,
				11, 15, § 76</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 5,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 1, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 446</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Ov.
				M. 10, 100</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 661</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1,
				2, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 15, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Ep. 1, 16, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 8, 3, 8 al.</span></i>— <b>Poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(vitis) conjuncta ulmo marito,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					62, 54</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: ulmorum Acheruns, <i>the Acheron of elm-rods</i>, of one who is often beaten, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Am.
				4, 2, 9</span></i>; cf. ulmitriba: Falernae, i. e. <i>Falernian vines</i>, for <i>Falernian wine</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Juv.
				6, 150</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viduae,</span>”
				<i>without vines</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					78</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
